        "text": "🚨 Announcing @fusionistio 2nd Free Mint Event: 641 in-game playable Mechs 🚨\n\nEvent Time: Nov. 16th 20:00 PT  -&gt;  Nov. 22nd 20:00 PT \n\nFull details: https://t.co/gVUwMIRVDS\n\nHow to get whitelisted for this Mech free mint 🧵👇🏽 https://t.co/TEbqpq7Dxp"
